  ('f2', 'One family, three stars: Dekada ''70', 'Vilma Santos, Christopher de Leon and Piolo Pascual all share one family in Chito S. Roño''s 2002 drama.', 'Dekada ''70 (2002) follows the Bartolome family through the 1970s. Vilma Santos plays the mother, Amanda; Christopher de Leon is the father, Julián; and Piolo Pascual plays their eldest son, Jules.

