  ('f4', 'Marian Rivera''s Balota sweep', 'Her turn as a teacher in the political thriller won Best Actress at Cinemalaya and the FAMAS Awards.', 'Marian Rivera, best known as the Kapuso "Primetime Queen" of fantasy hits like Marimar and Dyesebel, took a very different role in Kip Oebanda''s political thriller Balota (2024). Playing Emmy, a teacher thrust into danger, she won Best Actress at the 20th Cinemalaya festival and later at the FAMAS Awards.', 'PinoyStars Features', 2, now() - interval '2 days', '/seed/news/f4.png', 'Awards', 'marian-rivera'),
  ('f5', 'The Can''t Buy Me Love class', 'Donny Pangilinan and Maris Racal both found big roles in the 2023–2024 ABS-CBN drama.', 'Can''t Buy Me Love (2023–2024) gave Donny Pangilinan the role of Andrei "Bingo" Mariano, and Maris Racal her breakthrough as Irene Tiu. Racal went on to lead Sunshine (2024), shown at the 49th Toronto International Film Festival, and joined the action drama series Incognito in 2025.', 'PinoyStars Features', 3, now() - interval '3 days', '/seed/news/f5.png', 'New Gen', 'maris-racal'),
  ('f6', 'From "Mr. DJ" to Megastar', 'Sharon Cuneta was a chart-topping singer before she became one of the biggest film stars of the 1980s.', 'Sharon Cuneta released her first single, "Tawag ng Pag-ibig", in 1978 and broke out with "Mr. DJ". Her film debut, Dear Heart (1981), started a run of hits including Bituing Walang Ningning (1985) and Madrasta (1996). In 2004 she won Best Actress at the Brussels International Film Festival for Crying Ladies.', 'PinoyStars Features', 3, now() - interval '3 days', '/seed/news/f6.png', 'Legends', 'sharon-cuneta')
